        <div class="price">
            ₹15 / KM
        </div>

        <ul>

            <li>
                Minimum coverage: 130 KM
            </li>

            <li>
                Driver allowance: ₹400
            </li>

            <li>
                Toll / Permit / Parking — Extra
            </li>

            <li>
                Waiting charges — Extra
            </li>

        </ul>

        <small>
